  id: woodcutterslodge
  displayName: The Woodcutter's Lodge
  description: You came home with hardwood on your back, and a hatchet won't make planks of it. A lodge with a sawbench turns logs into planks, and the smithy, the walls and the storage shed all start with a plank. Build it near the trees (G).
  chain: The First Days
  journalNotes: Planks, not logs. That is the difference between a camp and a place people stay.
